### Get all users unauthenticated
GET http://localhost:5196/users
Accept: application/json
### Get all users authenticated
GET http://localhost:5196/users
Authorization: secret-token
Accept: application/json
###
GET http://localhost:5196/test-error
Accept: application/json

### Get user by id (replace 1 with the id you want)
GET http://localhost:5196/users/99
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:5196/users
Authorization: secret-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "basil",
  "email": "basil@.com",
  "department": "HR"
}

###

### Update an existing user (partial or full). Replace 1 with the target id
PUT http://localhost:5196/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alaa Updated",
  "email": "alaa.updated@example.com",
  "department": "Product"
}

###

### Delete a user by id (replace 1 with the id to delete)
DELETE http://localhost:5196/users/1
Accept: application/json

###
